## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to reason about on-device ML, privacy, and cost trade-offs for a common feature.

## Key Concepts
- On-device ML footprint
- Energy and storage budgeting
- Privacy by design and opt-in telemetry
- Cadence and go/no-go criteria

